# Skills & Auto-Trigger Rules

## File-Based Skills (auto-enforced via dedicated .mdc rules)

- `write-testcase-console` -- triggers on `**/test-cases/**/*.md` (see `testcase-polarion-html.mdc`)
- `write-automation-script-cypress` -- triggers on `**/cypress/**/*.spec.js, **/cypress/**/*.js` (see `cypress-automation.mdc`)
- `write-automation-script-playwright` -- triggers on `**/console-e2e/**/*.spec.ts, **/console-e2e/**/*.ts` (see `playwright-automation.mdc`)
- `create-rule` -- triggers on `**/.cursor/rules/**/*.mdc`
- `create-skill` -- triggers on `**/skills/**/SKILL.md`
- `update-cursor-settings` -- triggers on `**/settings.json`

